      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with stable recovery after the heart event do well once it's treated properly. I'm sending you for a lipid profile because of cardiovascular risk. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'm sending you for an echocardiogram because of follow-up. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture.",
